1
00:00:00,542 --> 00:00:02,082
(Raj:)Yeah, but not my worst, either.

2
00:00:06,815 --> 00:00:08,815
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry for every mean thing
I ever did or said to you!

3
00:00:08,984 --> 00:00:11,124
I'm sorry, too!
It's all my fault!

4
00:00:12,821 --> 00:00:15,491
(Sheldon:)If you weren't my friend,
there'd be a hole in my life!

5
00:00:15,657 --> 00:00:17,067
(Howard:)Thank you, Sheldon.

6
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:19,435
(Sheldon:)Kind of like when
Firefly was cancelled.

7
00:00:21,129 --> 00:00:22,469
(Sheldon:)But not as big.

8
00:00:30,138 --> 00:00:32,448
(Announcement:)The captain has turned off
the fasten seat belt sign.

9
00:00:32,608 --> 00:00:34,678
(Announcement:)You're now free
to move about the cabin.

10
00:00:36,178 --> 00:00:37,988
(Howard:)-It's over.
-Yeah.

11
00:00:41,149 --> 00:00:43,929
(Howard:)Should we stop
holding hands now?

12
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:48,298
(Howard:)-In a minute.
-Okay, good.

